From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Josh McKinney <joshka@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Jan 1970 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: git: persist fetched refs in repo view

Store fetched Git refs in the view so one-off fetches survive across operations
without becoming Git bookmarks. Include view merges, remote rename/remove
operations, and Git import reachability pinning

Keep fetched targets visible after local rewrites without moving the durable
remote labels. Carry the repository-view snapshot updates with the serialization
change

Co-authored-by: 4evy <git@evy.pink>
